<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 1.15 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 1.15 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to April 15 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to April 8:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 60,441	61,587</p>
<p> Money market intervention    14,854	13,293</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,904	 1,902</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,253	 2,254</p>
<p> Other				 6,826	 7,029</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,354	86,065</p>
<p>In the previous week, to April 8, reserves rose by 1.89 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
